<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE TO RESTART TRADE SOON.</title>
<headline>BOURSE TO RESTART TRADE SOON.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn bourse said on Friday that trade would restart soon after being stopped at 1100 due to more technical problems.</p>
<p>&quot;We have problems but we will manage,&quot; a bourse official told Reuters.</p>
<p>The official added that trade would start in the next 30 minutes.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
